components_count_badges.py, components_missing_bases.py, components_report.py and
components_where_used.py from fontlab-python-examples/_old/part4/fontlab-samples-L1/samples/.
App components.py shares ordered component/count/offset/missing/reverse-index
reads, plain source snapshots and existing native-verified placed outline paths.
_components_dialog.py extends existing Proof/Names binding, signal and Close
lifecycle; _components_views.py retains the complete original badge-card painter.
Scriptmix retains original controls/class/key/helper/scenario interfaces and
appends exact source/destination hashes to migration.json. Originals remain
unchanged. Reviewed Appv0.2.13/Scriptmixv1.0.9 native/artifact acceptance is
recorded in WORK.md.

Read-only Anchors provenance
===========================

